---
source: crates/eyeship-report/src/catalog.rs
expression: "rendered(|out| render_explain(&HEALTHY, out))"
---
R001 depends_on does not wait for a healthy service
Severity: warning

Scenario:
    The API starts before the database accepts connections and crashes.

Fix:
    Add a healthcheck to the dependency and use `condition: service_healthy`.

Bad example:
    services:
      api:
        depends_on: [db]

Good example:
    services:
      api:
        depends_on:
          db:
            condition: service_healthy
